  dorrit: ["I fed the Mayor a bowl of soup in spring. He finished it this morning, mmhm.", "My mother had a pot. Her mother had the same pot. It's still not clean.", "Don't you tell Rocco, but I've been putting lard in his protein.", "I've never once tasted my own soup, mmhm. I'm afraid I'd stop.", "I set a place for Bartleby. He won't come. I set it anyway. It's for the place.", "It's Tuesday's. Tuesday was a good day for soup, mmhm.", "Pots are just bowls that believe in themselves.", "When I'm gone, bury me in stock. Not in the ground. Just in stock.", "Ottoline's never paid for a meal. I've never asked. We're both very proud of it.", "I can hear when a thing wants salt. It's a very lonely gift, mmhm.", "You've got your grandmother's appetite, I can tell. I've never met her. It's in the shoulders.", "That goose came in once and looked at my ledger. I don't have a ledger. She left me one."],
